Alembic scripts generated by austial-migrate.

- ``env.py`` delegates to ``austial.migrations.alembic_env`` so behavior stays in the
  framework rather than in a per-project copy.
- Revisions live under ``versions/``.
- Do not edit ``script.py.mako`` unless you know why -- see the ``austial.migrations``
  docs page for the (short) rationale.
